<title>USA: US Stockpile sells 100 tonnes tin at $2.74/lb.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile sells 100 tonnes tin at $2.74/lb.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 100 tonnes of stockpile tin at its daily offering Thursday to RMT of Brooklyn, N.Y. at a unit price of $2.74 per lb.</p>
